/T (It is important to remember that to apply for need-based aid, you must fill out the Free Application for Federal Student Aid \(FAFSA\) at fafsa.gov. FAFSA is not part of the Common App, and the Common App is not a substitute for a financial aid application.)
/E (It is important to remember that to apply for need-based aid, you must fill out the Free Application for Federal Student Aid \(FAFSA\) at fafsa.gov. FAFSA is not part of the Common App, and the Common App is not a substitute for a financial aid application.)
